he end and that size reflects the full message length.'}]}, {'group': 'Message exceeding the maximum DNS wire length', 'cases': [{'input': [], 'expected': 'An IOException (or a RuntimeException wrapped by SneakyThrows) thrown when toWire() attempts to serialise a message whose total length would be > Message.MAXLENGTH (65535).', 'description': 'Construct a Message with enough records (e.g., many large TXT records) so that the resulting wire format would exceed 65535 bytes. toWire() must detect this overflow and propagate an exception.'}]}]
